## Contributing

To add support for new protocols:

1. Add protocol identifier to `check_protocol_prefix/1`
2. Update `detect_protocols/1` with detection logic
3. Add tests for the new protocol
4. Update this documentation

Example:
```elixir
defp check_protocol_prefix(utf8) do
  cond do
    String.starts_with?(utf8, "YOUR_PROTOCOL_ADDRESS") ->
      ["Your Protocol Name"]
    # ... other protocols
  end
end
```
